      "writtenOn": "2026-01-07T09:07:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e since the dependency is on broader driver and feature upstreaming\n\nThat sounds like a fair statement.  In which case, please provide the links to those activities in-place of any pertaining directly to the limit increase.  It\u0027s important for us to see that meaningful progress is being made in order to justify holding on to delta for a significant amount of time - maintaining forever-delta is sub-optimal.\n\nMulti-year activities are acceptable, we\u0027re well accustomed to those. The original patch was posted over a year ago.  Requesting to see what progress has been made in that time sounds like like a reasonable request at this stage.",
      "parentUuid": "5e67631e_060ddb8b",
      "revId": "4c016e9c14c32276d8e294c804110e8ec40cee3c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
